# YuruDesign 1 baseline

Milestone tag: **yurudesign-1** (see `docs/YURUDESIGN-1.md`).

When fixing experience/category/index, preserve unless user asks otherwise:

1. Sol kategori rail — click → `active` + scroll to scene
2. Pin alignment — `left: var(--rail-w)`, no double-offset drift
3. Vitrine size — large hero in scene grid (not capped at ~540px)
4. Pin duration ~172% desktop — avoid reintroducing long empty scroll gaps
5. Surgical fixes only — see `skills/surgical-fix/SKILL.md`

Do not break working pages when touching shared CSS or GSAP init order.
